  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nA₃ = 15972\n\nA₅ = 19326.12\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nA = P × (1 + R ÷ 100)ⁿ\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ A₅ ÷ A₃ = (1 + R ÷ 100)⁵ ÷ (1 + R ÷ 100)³\n\n⇒ 19326.12 ÷ 15972 = (1 + R ÷ 100)²\n\n⇒ 19326.12 ÷ 15972 = 1.21\n\n⇒ (1 + R ÷ 100)² = 1.21\n\n⇒ 1 + R ÷ 100 = √1.21 = 1.1\n\n⇒ R ÷ 100 = 0.1\n\n⇒ R = 10%\n\n⇒ 15972 = P × (1.1)³\n\n⇒ 15972 = P × 1.331\n\n⇒ P = 15972 ÷ 1.331 = 12000\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 12000.**",
